Modifications (per Apache-2.0 §4b):
- Map cropped from the original 140x100 "the Ville" to window x[14,135] x y[6,40]
  (122x35 tiles) by client/scripts/the_ville_src/convert_ville_map.py
- Sector (room) names re-mapped to AITown's own resident/location names
- Walkability grid post-processed: cells unreachable from the player spawn
  within the cropped window are marked non-walkable
- Only the 13 tileset images actually used by the cropped window are bundled
